00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:04.390 align:start position:0%
the ultimate guessing trick is a way to  solve single selection questions even if  you have no clue what the correct answer  is the key is that exactly one of the  choices is correct and the others will  be similar to it but they can be  eliminated in turn looking at these four  choices only one of them has three x  cubed so right away we can eliminate  this answer choice  then of the remaining three answer  choices only one of them has two x  squared so we eliminate this answer  choice we are down to b and c  now focus on 11x 13 which is similar in  answer choices a and c  this makes b the outlier and we  eliminate answer choice b  we are left with answer choice c and  that is the correct answer this strategy  works best if you have no clue there's  no penalty for guessing and you have  extra time to fill in some blanks the  downside is it takes a lot of time so if  you're good enough to apply this  strategy you're probably good enough to  just prepare for the test and solve it  because that is an age-old technique  that works almost every time
 

